OL,3,GNEWSAOlympic champion wants to see
OL,4,Askate park reopened
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Olympic BMX rider has said she wants
OL,7,Fto see the skate park which helped her
OL,8,Fwin gold at the Olympics to reopen.
OL,10,FCharlotte Worthington used RUSH Skate
OL,11,FPark, near Stroud in Gloucestershire,
OL,12,Fto train, along with Olympic bronze
OL,13,Fmedallist Declan Brooks and Olympic
OL,14,Fsilver medallist Kieran Reilly.
OL,16,FProfessional scooter rider Jay Sweet,
OL,17,Ffrom Dursley in Gloucestershire, also
OL,18,Ftrained at the park, which closed in
OL,19,FAugust 2021, and he has now taken over
OL,20,Fthe charity that aims to reopen it.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
