OL,3,GNEWSAOlympic champion wants to see
OL,4,Askate park reopened
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Rush made me the person I am today. If
OL,7,Fit wasn't for that park, I definitely
OL,8,Fwouldn't be at the level I am in my
OL,9,Fsport right now. I just want to give
OL,10,Ffuture generations the same chance,"
OL,11,Fsaid Sweet.
